        'A temperature field is absent in 20% of night-shift records and 1% of day-shift records. Filling all gaps with the training median keeps rows usable, but hides the pattern unless missingness is also recorded. Investigate the sensor and assess whether the model is learning shift identity rather than temperature effects.',
